Welcome to the Department of English at Arizona State University!  To best serve you and to help you plan out your major map, I would recommend scheduling an appointment with one of our amazing advisors. Please schedule a phone appointment or an in person appointment with one of our academic advisors through our online EZ appointment scheduler at: https://english.clas.asu.edu/advising . 

If you wish to schedule a phone appointment, you will be scheduling in the same location as the in person appointments because all three of our counselors do phone appointments and in person appointments. In the notes section please indicate that it is a phone appointment, the number you wished to be called and the reason for the appointment. 
Have a wonderful semester! 

Regards,

Your English Department Advising Team

